    "checked_on": "2026-10-06",
    "mapping": "For actual smooth area-preserving Anosov G on the compact boundaryless torus, normalized area is absolutely continuous and invariant; smooth DG is Holder. The entropy formula gives h_area(G)=integral log JuG, without ergodicity. With Ruelle and mixing Gibbs uniqueness this identifies the pressure-zero area measure used for norm-uniform weighted periodic EQ. Errata correct intermediate estimates and add no hypothesis to equation(2).",
